 61NI4c  daughter nucleus                                                       
 61NI c  2015Cv01: {+61}Cu produced in {+60}Ni(p,|g),E=2.48 MeV reaction        
 61NI2c  using natural Ni and NiO targets. Measured decay rates for |g          
 61NI3c  rays using a planar HPGe detector, deduced half-life of {+61}Cu decay. 
